            "notes": "# Round 1\n\n## AP Start\n[Lille F\u00e6lde](item_d92c59ae-b2f5-48e5-9f60-66144441eee8) : The objective obviously is to farm cash with updraft-bolas, but [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) and [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) guarantee you use your ult at least twice in a steamroll to try and turn it around.\n\n## WP Start\n[Seekerpoint](item_7174fb2f-38d3-48d4-8705-5d90ac72876e) : If you want to poke/burst more early or the enemy team doesn't have flyers or a Zarya, take [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) with an [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6).\n\n## Hybrid Start\nYou can also go [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)+[Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) with either Power and take [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) or [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6).",
