            "notes": "# Round 3\n\nThis is where the build gets weird as money is wild and people are too.\n\n## AP Start : [So Cooked](item_0d93a9b8-c485-4ee8-accd-b706bbc23cfb) \nThis is usually where I take [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) with the survival combo, but any AP/cooldowm items will do.\n\n## WP Start\nYou can choose:\n\n[Lille F\u00e6lde](item_d92c59ae-b2f5-48e5-9f60-66144441eee8) : If you want to spec into AP early, look at the notes for the items. I try to lean more towards AP when taking Lille early, things like [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) and [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), but [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) synergizes with [Seekerpoint](item_7174fb2f-38d3-48d4-8705-5d90ac72876e) perfectly if you aim it right.\n\n[Cyclone](item_197843aa-de82-4387-b6c9-e5e1549b4832) : You can also postpone AP and take Cyclone early if there's not a lot of barriers. Paired with [Tourniquet](item_f457a404-70c1-4f1b-b6da-8fa2e90aad54) lets you get a lot of bolts out very quickly. Attack speed can be good on Freya, it reduces the Take Aim drawtime/downtime, but its better to focus on damage since this build is best at burst combos and Quick Dash resets Take Aim anyway.",
